WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.142
Cinderella stared at her fairy godmother.

2
00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:09.475
"Really? I can go to the ball?"

3
00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.764
Godmother nodded. "Yes.

4
00:00:12.765 --> 00:00:17.384
Run to the garden and bring me a pumpkin."

5
00:00:17.385 --> 00:00:26.174
"A pumpkin?" Cinderella went to the garden.

6
00:00:26.175 --> 00:00:32.461
She found a nice pumpkin and ran back.

7
00:00:32.462 --> 00:00:44.664
"Here!" Cinderella set the pumpkin in front of Godmother.

8
00:00:44.665 --> 00:00:48.054
Godmother tapped it with her wand. Zap!

9
00:00:48.055 --> 00:00:51.534
The pumpkin was now a golden coach!

10
00:00:51.535 --> 00:00:55.525
"Next we need some horses," Godmother said.

11
00:00:55.526 --> 00:01:13.507
"I'll find some mice!" Cinderella said.

12
00:01:13.508 --> 00:01:17.956
Godmother counted. "One. Two. Three. Four."

13
00:01:17.957 --> 00:01:22.999
Zap! The mice turned into a team of horses.

14
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.653
"Hmm." Godmother looked around.

15
00:01:26.654 --> 00:01:31.920
"Who will drive the golden coach?"

16
00:01:31.921 --> 00:01:35.542
"There are rats in the cellar," Cinderella said.

17
00:01:35.543 --> 00:01:38.246
"Perfect!" Godmother replied.

18
00:01:38.247 --> 00:01:46.455
"Bring me one!"

19
00:01:46.456 --> 00:01:47.489
Zap!

20
00:01:47.490 --> 00:02:03.184
Soon a jolly driver with whiskers stood there.

21
00:02:03.185 --> 00:02:05.633
Zap! Zap!

22
00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:08.967
Two lizards became handsome servants.

23
00:02:08.968 --> 00:02:17.078
Godmother smiled. "Your coach is ready, my dear!"

24
00:02:17.079 --> 00:02:21.737
"But . . ." Cinderella pointed at her clothes.

25
00:02:21.738 --> 00:02:24.972
The fairy touched her lightly with the wand.

26
00:02:24.973 --> 00:02:27.472
Zap!

27
00:02:27.473 --> 00:02:30.603
Cinderella's ugly rags were gone.

28
00:02:30.604 --> 00:02:34.840
Now she wore a beautiful gown with sparkling jewels.

29
00:02:34.841 --> 00:02:36.472
And on her feet . . .

30
00:02:36.473 --> 00:02:44.517
Cinderella wore the prettiest glass shoes in the world!

31
00:02:44.518 --> 00:02:48.295
She climbed into the coach.

32
00:02:48.296 --> 00:03:01.331
"Good-bye, Godmother! I'm off to the ball!"

